        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 42, Modern Interior Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia has done it again with their impeccable eye for style and elegance. The # 42 Interior Modern Lever Latchset has a very sleek design that makes it a great choice for contemporary homes. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions in a wide array of finishes including polished brass, satin chrome, and oil rubbed bronze. Easy to install, the Omnia 42/00 Leverset will fit most standard pre-drilled doors with thicknesses of 1-3/8 inches, 1-3/4 inches, or 2 inches. It is available with either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Interior Door Lever with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 42 Interior Modern Door Lever with Round Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/locking-door-bars.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"514\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Interior Modern Lever Latchset",
                "description": "Omnia 42/00, Interior Modern Lever Latchset - Omnia has done it again with their impeccable eye for style and elegance. The # 42 Interior Modern Lever Latchset has a very sleek design that makes it a great choice for contemporary homes. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions in a wide array of finishes including polished brass, satin chrome, and oil rubbed bronze. Easy to install, the Omnia 42/00 Leverset will fit standard pre-drilled doors with thicknesses of 1-3/8 inches, 1-3/4 inches, or 2 inches. It is available with either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset.",
